1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:06,146
Across government, AI agents are beginning to work together on citizen services:

2
00:00:06,146 --> 00:00:10,090
checking eligibility, sharing tasks, and collecting fees.

3
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:15,170
But what happens when a legitimate agent, with a genuine identity,

4
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:19,395
reaches for another citizen's record, one it was never authorized to see?

5
00:00:20,702 --> 00:00:25,314
WAKALA checks every request against signed, case-specific authority.

6
00:00:25,564 --> 00:00:27,143
In our working prototype,

7
00:00:27,143 --> 00:00:30,998
the request is blocked before any protected data is returned.

8
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:35,815
An authorized security officer reviews the incident,

9
00:00:35,815 --> 00:00:41,413
contains only the affected authority, and hands the task to a trusted standby agent.

10
00:00:42,369 --> 00:00:46,581
After the required approval, Mariam's renewal completes safely,

11
00:00:46,581 --> 00:00:52,331
every decision stays on record, and another citizen's application continues untouched.

12
00:00:53,901 --> 00:00:58,799
WAKALA. Autonomous AI. Accountable actions.
